{
    "title": "HungryPanda: Food Delivery",
    "description": "Too busy to cook? Craving for the most authentic Asian cuisines? Wanna enjoy tasty food and great service at the best price? HungryPanda should be your NO.1 Choice!\r\n\r\nHungryPanda-The most popular Asian food delivery online service!\r\nHere we have thousands of local Asian restaurants across Australia and New Zealand with the widest range of Asian food, especially Chinese cuisines to choose from. \r\nEditor\u2019s choice and real customer reviews help you get the perfect meals! Do not struggle anymore!\r\n\r\nAll at the tap of a button, you can get your favorite dishes delivered straight to your doorstep instantly or pick them up by your way without waiting in long lines! Enjoying a satisfying meal has never been so easy and quick!\r\n\r\n\u3010New users\u3011 can get up to $8 off on first order, super-discount coupons for delivery fee to enjoy daily free delivery service and up to 30%OFF for pick-up order! (T&Cs Apply)\r\n\r\n\u3010Key Features\u3011\r\n\u00b7Easily get your everyday special coupons on the home page\r\n\u00b7Flexibility between getting meals delivered or picking-up\r\n\u00b7Exclusive discounts for VIPs and balance top-up\r\n\u00b7Filter by restaurant name, cuisine, dish, distance, rating, discount, most popular\r\n\u00b7In-app real-time estimated delivery time, order status update and courier map-tracking\r\n\u00b7Customer ratings and reviews with real images for each restaurant\r\n\u00b7Quickly re-order from any of your favorite restaurants and past meals\r\n\u00b7Same day delivery service for online grocery supermarket \r\n\u00b7Conveniently pay via debit/credit card, Apple Pay, Pay Pal, Alipay, Wechat Pay, Union Pay\r\n\u00b7Order for now or for later meals\r\n\u00b724/7 customer service\r\n\u00b7Contact-free delivery\r\n\r\n\u3010Variety of Cuisines\u3011\r\nMilk Tea, Roast Duck, Hot Pots(Malatang), Dumplings, Dandan noodles, traditional street food, Boiled Fish, Sichuanese, Cantonese, Northeast Chinese cuisine, Home Cooking, Fried Chicken, BBQ, Desserts, Cakes, Japanese, Korean, Southeast Asian, etc.\r\n\r\n\u3010About HungryPanda\u3011\r\nWith more than 50,000 restaurants across 10 countries and 90+ cities, HungryPanda is the biggest global platform for overseas Chinese & Asian foodies.\r\nThe widest range of authentic Asian food, delivered right to your door by HungryPanda, the first choice worldwide for Asian cooking enthusiasts. Delivery, takeaway, dine-in discounts, fresh & rare ingredients from Asian supermarkets & more help you enjoy the best local Eastern cuisine, wherever you may live.\r\n\r\n\u3010Panda Fresh\u3011-HungryPanda Ecosystem\r\nTop fresh food app worldwide for overseas Chinese, with fast delivery of not just fresh fruits & vegetables, meat, poultry, eggs, milk, rice, flour & oil, but also HOT trending snacks like Liziqi Snail Noodles, Meixin Mooncakes, Liulihai Spicy Shrimp Tails, Wang Xiaohao Braised Pig Feet, Wang Baofeng Cereals & Self-Heating Instant Noodles.",
